{"fps":23.976023976023978,"duration":319.85,"segments":[{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-1","t0":0,"t1":11.13,"in":0.23,"out":11.36},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-2","t0":11.13,"t1":40.35,"in":17.59,"out":46.81},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-3","t0":40.35,"t1":96.25,"in":53.88,"out":109.78},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-4","t0":96.25,"t1":151.69,"in":119.53,"out":174.97},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-5","t0":151.69,"t1":208.16,"in":183.17,"out":239.64},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-6","t0":208.16,"t1":287.77,"in":248.09,"out":327.7},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-7","t0":287.77,"t1":298.78,"in":331.99,"out":343},{"kind":"clip","id":"lf-8","t0":298.78,"t1":313.84999999999997,"in":368.78,"out":383.85},{"kind":"card","name":"end","t0":313.84999999999997,"t1":319.84999999999997,"html":"<div class=\"num\" data-d=\"0.05\">For owners of $1M+ businesses</div><div class=\"ttl split\" data-d=\"0.2\">See if your business <em>qualifies</em>.</div><div class=\"rule\"></div><div data-d=\"1.1\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;margin-top:10px\"><span class=\"btn\">See if you qualify →</span><span class=\"url\">apply.grosfjeld-li.com</span></div>","fine":"Results are not typical and depend on your business, market and the deals available to you. Nothing in this video is financial, legal or tax advice. Acquisitions involve risk, including the loss of money invested; get independent professional advice before entering any transaction. Some examples are Josh's friends and network, not clients."}],"beats":[{"t0":0.17,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Buying a profitable company</div><div class=\"big split\" data-d=\"0.2\">Having no money is <em>not</em> the obstacle.</div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"420\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 16\" style=\"margin-top:-4px\"><path data-draw data-d=\"1.6\" data-dur=\"0.7\" d=\"M2 10 C 126 4, 273 14, 418 7\"/></svg>","clip":"lf-1","t1":11.24},{"t0":11.24,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Here’s why</div><div class=\"big split\" data-d=\"0.2\">A bank lends against the <em>business</em>.</div><div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"10.81\">Not you.</div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 130 120\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"1.4\" data-dur=\"0.7\" d=\"M10 40 L65 10 L120 40 Z\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"1.9\" data-dur=\"0.35\" d=\"M28 48 L28 96\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"1.98\" data-dur=\"0.35\" d=\"M52 48 L52 96\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"2.06\" data-dur=\"0.35\" d=\"M78 48 L78 96\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"2.1399999999999997\" data-dur=\"0.35\" d=\"M102 48 L102 96\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"2.3\" data-dur=\"0.4\" d=\"M8 104 L122 104\"/></svg>","clip":"lf-2","t1":23.94},{"t0":23.94,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">But only if</div><div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"0.2\">You talk to the <em>right</em> bankers.</div>","clip":"lf-2","t1":30.439999999999998},{"t0":30.439999999999998,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Who to talk to</div><div class=\"chk\"><div class=\"r no\" data-d=\"0.3\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"0.44999999999999996\" data-dur=\"0.25\" d=\"M10 10 L30 30\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"0.6299999999999999\" data-dur=\"0.25\" d=\"M30 10 L10 30\"/></svg><span>Home-loan banker</span></div><div class=\"r no\" data-d=\"22.85\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"23\" data-dur=\"0.25\" d=\"M10 10 L30 30\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"23.18\" data-dur=\"0.25\" d=\"M30 10 L10 30\"/></svg><span>General business banker</span></div><div class=\"r\" data-d=\"37.11\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"37.26\" data-dur=\"0.45\" d=\"M7 21 L16 30 L33 10\"/></svg><span>Banker who knows your industry</span></div></div>","clip":"lf-2","t1":80.47},{"t0":80.47,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Tell an industry banker you’re rolling up</div><div class=\"quote\" data-d=\"0.3\">“Oh, what a great idea.”</div><div class=\"quote\" data-d=\"13.32\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)\">“Good luck. It’s hard.”</div>","clip":"lf-3","t1":96.42},{"t0":96.42,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">So what is the obstacle?</div><div class=\"big split\" data-d=\"0.2\">It’s <em>not</em> the money.</div>","clip":"lf-4","t1":102.02},{"t0":102.02,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">The banker</div><div class=\"big split\" data-d=\"0.2\">Funds the <span class=\"ring\">asset<svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 50\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"4.98\" data-dur=\"0.9\" d=\"M88 12 C 70 0, 18 2, 6 18 C -4 34, 30 50, 62 47 C 92 44, 104 26, 86 10 C 80 5, 70 3, 60 3\"/></svg></span>. Not you.</div>","clip":"lf-4","t1":112.42},{"t0":112.42,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">So present your deal</div><div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"0.2\">As an asset that <em>spits out cash</em>.</div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"170\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 170 120\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"2\" data-dur=\"0.7\" d=\"M10 10 L10 110 L165 110\"/><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"2.6\" data-dur=\"0.8\" d=\"M22 92 L60 70 L92 80 L150 24\"/><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"3.3\" data-dur=\"0.3\" d=\"M132 22 L151 23 L148 42\"/></svg>","clip":"lf-4","t1":136.82},{"t0":136.82,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Not Shark Tank</div><div class=\"row2\"><div data-d=\"0.2\"><div class=\"h\">Shark Tank</div><div class=\"s\">Funds the entrepreneur</div></div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"2\" height=\"170\" viewBox=\"0 0 2 170\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"0.6000000000000001\" data-dur=\"0.6\" d=\"M1 0 L1 170\"/></svg><div data-d=\"19.52\"><div class=\"h\">Business lenders</div><div class=\"s\">Fund the company</div></div></div>","clip":"lf-4","t1":160.62},{"t0":160.62,"html":"<div class=\"small\" data-d=\"0.2\">They may still want security and personal guarantees. That’s a separate conversation.</div>","clip":"lf-5","t1":177.62},{"t0":177.62,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">The only question</div><div class=\"big split\" data-d=\"0.2\">Is this asset <span class=\"ring\">bankable<svg class=\"ln\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 50\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"3.38\" data-dur=\"0.9\" d=\"M88 12 C 70 0, 18 2, 6 18 C -4 34, 30 50, 62 47 C 92 44, 104 26, 86 10 C 80 5, 70 3, 60 3\"/></svg></span>?</div><div class=\"small\" data-d=\"6.92\">Can it spit out enough cash to make the repayments?</div>","clip":"lf-5","t1":188.01999999999998},{"t0":188.01999999999998,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Why most people don’t get the loan</div><div class=\"row2\"><div data-d=\"0.2\"><div class=\"h\">Home loans</div><div class=\"s\">Simple. Low variability.</div></div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"2\" height=\"170\" viewBox=\"0 0 2 170\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"0.6000000000000001\" data-dur=\"0.6\" d=\"M1 0 L1 170\"/></svg><div data-d=\"3.98\"><div class=\"h\">Business</div><div class=\"s\">More risk, more variability.</div></div></div><div class=\"small\" data-d=\"15.24\">They don’t know how to <b>present it</b>.</div>","clip":"lf-5","t1":208.27},{"t0":208.27,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">What the bank wants to see</div><div class=\"chk\"><div class=\"r\" data-d=\"0.2\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"0.35\" data-dur=\"0.45\" d=\"M7 21 L16 30 L33 10\"/></svg><span>Revenue</span></div><div class=\"r\" data-d=\"5.22\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"5.37\" data-dur=\"0.45\" d=\"M7 21 L16 30 L33 10\"/></svg><span>Profitability</span></div><div class=\"r\" data-d=\"13.19\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"13.34\" data-dur=\"0.45\" d=\"M7 21 L16 30 L33 10\"/></svg><span>Super paid</span></div><div class=\"r\" data-d=\"15.37\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"15.52\" data-dur=\"0.45\" d=\"M7 21 L16 30 L33 10\"/></svg><span>Tax paid</span></div><div class=\"r\" data-d=\"35.82\"><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" style=\"\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"35.97\" data-dur=\"0.45\" d=\"M7 21 L16 30 L33 10\"/></svg><span>A trading history</span></div></div>","clip":"lf-6","t1":250.76999999999998},{"t0":250.76999999999998,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Tick those boxes and the lender asks</div><div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"0.2\">“How much do you <em>want</em>?”</div><div class=\"small\" data-d=\"5.76\">It’s about presenting the case.</div>","clip":"lf-6","t1":258.87},{"t0":258.87,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">The number that matters</div><div class=\"frac\"><div class=\"f\"><div data-d=\"5\">Free cash flow</div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"330\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 330 6\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"5.4\" data-dur=\"0.6\" d=\"M2 3 L328 3\"/></svg><div data-d=\"5.7\">Debt repayments</div></div><div data-d=\"6.4\">=</div><div class=\"res\" data-d=\"6.8\">DSCR</div></div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"300\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 16\" style=\"margin-top:-4px\"><path class=\"g\" data-draw data-d=\"10.96\" data-dur=\"0.7\" d=\"M2 10 C 90 4, 195 14, 298 7\"/></svg>","clip":"lf-6","t1":270.17},{"t0":270.17,"html":"<div class=\"small\" data-d=\"0.2\">More on DSCR, and finding how much cash a business really makes, in Josh’s other videos.</div>","clip":"lf-6","t1":282.77},{"t0":282.77,"html":"<div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"0.2\">It’s not about how much money <em>you</em> have.</div>","clip":"lf-6","t1":287.88},{"t0":287.88,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Behind the clinic</div><div class=\"small\" data-d=\"0.3\">“A filthy smoker in a healthcare environment.”</div>","clip":"lf-7","t1":298.9},{"t0":298.9,"html":"<div class=\"eyebrow\" data-d=\"0\">Remember</div><div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"0.2\">You don’t need money to buy a company.</div><div class=\"mid split\" data-d=\"7.13\">You need a company that’s <em>making</em> money.</div><svg class=\"ln\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 30\" style=\"\"><path data-draw data-d=\"12.43\" data-dur=\"0.5\" d=\"M2 15 L114 15\"/><path data-draw data-d=\"12.83\" data-dur=\"0.3\" d=\"M100 4 L116 15 L100 26\"/></svg>","clip":"lf-8","t1":313.84999999999997}],"captions":[{"t0":0.15,"words":[["having",0.15,0.39,0],["no",0.39,0.63,0],["money",0.63,0.91,0],["is",0.91,1.15,0],["not",1.15,1.35,0],["the",1.35,1.51,0],["obstacle",1.51,1.87,0],["that's",1.87,2.27,0]],"t1":2.27},{"t0":2.27,"words":[["stopping",2.27,2.63,0],["you",2.63,2.99,0],["from",2.99,3.79,0],["buying",3.79,4.19,0],["a",4.19,4.63,0],["company,",4.63,4.95,0],["a",5.17,5.25,0],["cash",5.25,6.19,0]],"t1":6.19},{"t0":6.19,"words":[["flowing,",6.19,6.53,0],["profitable,",6.67,7.17,0],["multi",7.37,7.51,0],["-million",7.51,7.85,1],["dollar",7.85,8.07,0]],"t1":8.07},{"t0":8.07,"words":[["company.",8.07,8.45,0]],"t1":9.049999999999999},{"t0":9.33,"words":[["Having",9.33,9.45,0],["no",9.45,9.65,0],["money",9.65,9.85,0],["is",9.85,9.99,0],["not",9.99,10.27,0],["the",10.27,10.47,0],["obstacle.",10.47,10.83,0]],"t1":11.13},{"t0":11.280000000000001,"words":[["The",11.280000000000001,11.440000000000001,0],["reason",11.440000000000001,11.58,0],["for",11.58,11.940000000000001,0],["that",11.940000000000001,12.14,0],["is",12.14,12.3,0],["because",12.3,13.020000000000001,0]],"t1":13.620000000000001},{"t0":15.010000000000002,"words":[["a",15.010000000000002,15.75,0],["bank",15.75,16.07,0],["lends",16.07,16.67,0],["against",16.67,17.51,0],["the",17.51,18.37,0],["business,",18.37,18.89,0],["the",19.23,19.41,0],["asset",19.41,19.93,0]],"t1":19.93},{"t0":19.93,"words":[["that",19.93,20.55,0],["is",20.55,20.71,0],["in",20.71,20.85